  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;On the basis of the information provided, the Local Planning Authority, are not satisfied that the proposed use of the outbuilding as accommodation for a carer would remain incidental to the enjoyment use of the main dwellinghouse. The proposal would therefore fail to be within the tolerances of Schedule 2, Part 1, Class E of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended).&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposal is therefore a NOT lawful development.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
